SUMMARY:Deadline: Bibliothek Andreas Züst: Studio Residency for Duos and C
 ollectives\, Summer 2027 (six weeks in the Swiss Alps\; room\, board and t
 ravel covered\, living subsidy up to CHF 750)
DESCRIPTION:The Bibliothek Andreas Züst\, the 12\,000-volume private libra
 ry of the Swiss photographer\, collector and polymath Andreas Züst\, is h
 oused at the Alpenhof lodge above the Rhine Valley and offers studio resid
 ency stipends for work in and around the collection. The summer 2027 round
  is for duos and collectives of up to five people.\n\nOrganisation: Biblio
 thek Andreas Züst\nLocation: Alpenhof panorama lodge\, St. Anton (Oberegg
 )\, Switzerland\, at 1\,110 m above the Rhine Valley and Lake Constance. O
 pen to national and international cultural workers\; no nationality or age
  rule is stated.\nAward: Accommodation\, food and use of the studio are fr
 ee\, and travel costs are covered. An additional subsidy for living costs 
 of up to CHF 750 can be requested separately. No application fee stated.\n
 Duration: 6 weeks (4 July to 15 August 2027)\n\nMore: https://bibliothekan
 dreaszuest.net/en/residency?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
 um=referral
URL:https://bibliothekandreaszuest.net/en/residency?utm_source=artificialno
 uveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Alpenhof panorama lodge\, St. Anton (Oberegg)\, Switzerland\, at 1
 \,110 m above the Rhine Valley and Lake Constance. Open to national and in
 ternational cultural workers\; no nationality or age rule is stated.
END:VEVENT
